<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
    Hot Reload Parameters plugin — reads parameter definitions from a Groovy DSL file
    in a Git repo branch. When the trigger parameter (e.g. RELEASE_BRANCH) changes on the
    "Build with Parameters" page, the plugin fetches the matching branch's config and
    re-renders all dynamic parameters in-place via AJAX.
</div>
